DATA LICENSE NOTICE:

This application retrieves data from public research APIs including PubMed/NCBI
E-utilities, Europe PMC REST API, ClinicalTrials.gov API v2, Open Targets Platform
API, and PubChem REST API. Each data source retains its own license and terms of use.
Users must respect the attribution requirements and data licenses of each source:

- PubMed: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/
- Europe PMC: https://europepmc.org/About
- ClinicalTrials.gov: https://clinicaltrials.gov/about-site/terms-conditions
- Open Targets: https://platform.opentargets.org/about
- PubChem: https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/docs/about

The MIT license above applies to the application source code only, not to the
data retrieved from these external sources.
